                  "gap_ref": null,
                  "unit_class": "text",
                  "state": "known"
                },
                {
                  "text": "S1 p.143, Geographic Area Information: “Net sales are measured based on the geographic destination of sales”; table United States / Foreign Countries. Source FY2024 cells: “$5,032” / “2,908”; total “$7,940”. “Net sales and long-lived assets of individual countries outside of the United States are not material.”",
