                  "unit_class": "text",
                  "state": "known"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Foreign customer destinations introduce export/FX and regional demand exposure → geography informs operating risk, not the legal location of cash, collateral or obligors.",
                  "prov": "cited",
                  "ref_id": "C34",
                  "gap_ref": null,
                  "unit_class": "text",
                  "state": "known"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Geographic destination is not functional currency or manufacturing location. Separate foreign-country figures unavailable: measure = null. Values quoted directly, no geographic percentages calculated.",
