                  "text": "Documentary Fact",
                  "prov": "cited",
                  "ref_id": "C38",
                  "gap_ref": null,
                  "unit_class": "text",
                  "state": "known"
                },
                {
                  "text": "S1 p.6: “assigning a business unit manager that leads a business unit team”; functions include operations, engineering, quality and sales. Manufacturing description: “Most of our manufacturing facilities are comprised of manufacturing, distribution and engineering functions”.",
                  "prov": "cited",
                  "ref_id": "C38",
                  "gap_ref": null,
                  "unit_class": "text",
                  "state": "known"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Local product responsibility connects pricing/cost decisions to execution, but adds integration/control interfaces → monitor acquired-unit reporting and quality processes, not personal competence.",
                  "prov": "cited",
                  "ref_id": "C38",
                  "gap_ref": null,
                  "unit_class": "text",
                  "state": "known"
                },
                {
